  "ui.chat.pickers.destination_pickers.copies_the_complete_history_into_a_new_conversation_at_the_next_safe_bou": "Sao ch\xE9p to\xE0n b\u1ED9 l\u1ECBch s\u1EED sang cu\u1ED9c tr\xF2 chuy\u1EC7n m\u1EDBi t\u1EA1i ranh gi\u1EDBi an to\xE0n ti\u1EBFp theo (sau b\u01B0\u1EDBc hi\u1EC7n t\u1EA1i c\u1EE7a tr\u1EE3 l\xFD v\xE0 k\u1EBFt qu\u1EA3 c\xF4ng c\u1EE5). Cu\u1ED9c tr\xF2 chuy\u1EC7n g\u1ED1c ti\u1EBFp t\u1EE5c ch\u1EA1y v\xE0 kh\xF4ng b\u1ECB thay \u0111\u1ED5i.",
