  "ui.common.updates.update_notification.please_wait_while_the_server_is_being_updated_the_update_can_t_be": "Vui l\xF2ng ch\u1EDD trong khi m\xE1y ch\u1EE7 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c c\u1EADp nh\u1EADt. Kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 ng\u1EAFt qu\xE1 tr\xECnh c\u1EADp nh\u1EADt sau khi b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u.",
