  "ui.common.updates.update_notification.run_this_in_a_terminal_this_install_was_built_from_this_machine_s": "Ch\u1EA1y l\u1EC7nh n\xE0y trong terminal. B\u1EA3n c\xE0i n\xE0y \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c d\u1EF1ng t\u1EEB b\u1EA3n m\xE3 ngu\u1ED3n tr\xEAn m\xE1y n\xE0y, n\xEAn `lop update` s\u1EBD c\xE0i \u0111\xE8 b\u1EA3n ph\xE1t h\xE0nh l\xEAn n\xF3 - v\xE0 n\u1EBFu m\xE1y n\xE0y c\xF3 `lop-update`, t\u1EADp l\u1EC7nh d\u1EF1ng l\u1EA1i b\u1EA3n c\xE0i t\u1EEB b\u1EA3n m\xE3 ngu\u1ED3n, h\xE3y ch\u1EA1y t\u1EADp l\u1EC7nh \u0111\xF3 sau \u0111\u1EC3 ti\u1EBFp t\u1EE5c theo b\u1EA3n m\xE3 ngu\u1ED3n.",
