  "ui.common.updates.update_notification.still_checking_a_slow_or_stalled_connection_can_hold_this_for_abo": "V\u1EABn \u0111ang ki\u1EC3m tra. K\u1EBFt n\u1ED1i ch\u1EADm ho\u1EB7c b\u1ECB treo c\xF3 th\u1EC3 khi\u1EBFn qu\xE1 tr\xECnh n\xE0y k\xE9o d\xE0i kho\u1EA3ng m\u1ED9t ph\xFAt r\u01B0\u1EE1i - \u1EE9ng d\u1EE5ng s\u1EBD t\u1EF1 ng\u1EEBng ch\u1EDD.",
  "ui.common.updates.update_notification.still_downloading_a_download_that_stops_making_progress_is_cancel": "V\u1EABn \u0111ang t\u1EA3i. Qu\xE1 tr\xECnh t\u1EA3i s\u1EBD b\u1ECB h\u1EE7y n\u1EBFu kh\xF4ng c\xF3 ti\u1EBFn tri\u1EC3n trong kho\u1EA3ng 90 gi\xE2y.",
