  "ui.common.updates.update_notification.the_app_updates_this_install_itself_the_server_you_are_using_was_": "C\xE1c phi\xEAn \u0111ang ch\u1EA1y kh\xF4ng b\u1ECB ng\u1EAFt. \u1EE8ng d\u1EE5ng t\u1EF1 c\u1EADp nh\u1EADt b\u1EA3n c\xE0i n\xE0y. M\xE1y ch\u1EE7 b\u1EA1n \u0111ang d\xF9ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c kh\u1EDFi ch\u1EA1y b\xEAn ngo\xE0i Local Operator, n\xEAn v\u1EABn ch\u1EA1y b\u1EA3n d\u1EF1ng c\u0169 cho \u0111\u1EBFn khi kh\u1EDFi \u0111\u1ED9ng l\u1EA1i.",
  "ui.common.updates.update_notification.the_app_waits_up_to_ten_minutes_for_them_then_stops_rather_than_c": "\u1EE8ng d\u1EE5ng ch\u1EDD c\xE1c l\u01B0\u1EE3t \u0111\xF3 t\u1ED1i \u0111a m\u01B0\u1EDDi ph\xFAt, r\u1ED3i d\u1EEBng thay v\xEC ng\u1EAFt l\u01B0\u1EE3t gi\u1EEFa ch\u1EEBng, n\xEAn kh\xF4ng t\xE1c v\u1EE5 \u0111ang ch\u1EA1y n\xE0o b\u1ECB ng\u1EAFt",
