  "ui.onboarding.connect.intro": "Ch\u1ECDn Radient \u0111\u1EC3 d\xF9ng nhi\u1EC1u m\xF4 h\xECnh, t\xEDnh n\u0103ng chuy\u1EC3n gi\u1ECDng n\xF3i th\xE0nh v\u0103n b\u1EA3n v\xE0 chia s\u1EBB t\xE1c nh\xE2n ch\u1EC9 v\u1EDBi m\u1ED9t l\u1EA7n \u0111\u0103ng nh\u1EADp qua tr\xECnh duy\u1EC7t. Ho\u1EB7c d\xF9ng g\xF3i Claude hay ChatGPT \u0111ang c\xF3, kh\xF3a API ho\u1EB7c m\u1ED9t m\xF4 h\xECnh tr\xEAn m\xE1y t\xEDnh c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n. T\xE0i kho\u1EA3n Radient m\u1EDBi \u0111\u1EE7 \u0111i\u1EC1u ki\u1EC7n c\xF3 th\u1EC3 nh\u1EADn t\xEDn d\u1EE5ng mi\u1EC5n ph\xED sau khi x\xE1c minh email v\xE0 qua b\u01B0\u1EDBc ki\u1EC3m tra b\u1EA3o m\u1EADt.",
