  "ui.settings.appearance.window_glass.unsupported_windows_too_old": "C\u1EEDa s\u1ED5 trong m\u1EDD c\u1EA7n Windows 11 phi\xEAn b\u1EA3n 22H2 tr\u1EDF l\xEAn.",
  "ui.settings.appearance.window_glass.unsupported_linux": "Kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 d\xF9ng c\u1EEDa s\u1ED5 trong m\u1EDD tr\xEAn Linux: \u1EE9ng d\u1EE5ng kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 y\xEAu c\u1EA7u h\u1EC7 th\u1ED1ng l\xE0m m\u1EDD c\u1EEDa s\u1ED5. \u0110\u1ED9 trong su\u1ED1t \u1EDF \u0111\xE2y ph\u1EE5 thu\u1ED9c v\xE0o b\u1ED9 t\u1ED5ng h\u1EE3p (X11 ho\u1EB7c Wayland) v\xE0 c\xF3 th\u1EC3 ph\u1EA3i d\xF9ng l\xE0m m\u1EDD b\u1EB1ng ph\u1EA7n m\u1EC1m, khi\u1EBFn ch\u1EEF tr\xEAn m\xE0n h\xECnh n\u1EC1n hi\u1EC7n xuy\xEAn qua ch\u1EEF c\u1EE7a \u1EE9ng d\u1EE5ng.",
  "ui.settings.appearance.window_glass.unsupported_other": "Kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 d\xF9ng c\u1EEDa s\u1ED5 trong m\u1EDD tr\xEAn n\u1EC1n t\u1EA3ng n\xE0y: ch\u1EC9 macOS \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c x\xE1c minh kh\u1EA3 n\u0103ng t\u1ED5ng h\u1EE3p c\u1EEDa s\u1ED5 m\u1EDD; ch\u1EA5t li\u1EC7u tr\xEAn Windows 11 ch\u01B0a \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ki\u1EC3m th\u1EED tr\xEAn m\xE1y th\u1EADt.",
