  "ui.settings.appearance.window_glass.coverage_description": "Nh\u1EEFng ph\u1EA7n c\u1EEDa s\u1ED5 s\u1EBD trong m\u1EDD. V\u1EDBi t\xF9y ch\u1ECDn \u201CCh\u1EC9 thanh b\xEAn\u201D, cu\u1ED9c tr\xF2 chuy\u1EC7n v\xE0 c\xE1c trang v\u1EABn c\xF3 n\u1EC1n kh\xF4ng trong su\u1ED1t. \u201CTo\xE0n \u1EE9ng d\u1EE5ng\u201D \xE1p d\u1EE5ng c\u1EA3 cho c\xE1c ph\u1EA7n n\xE0y v\xE0 c\xE1c b\u1EA3ng b\xEAn; trang web, t\xE0i li\u1EC7u v\xE0 \u1EA3nh hi\u1EC3n th\u1ECB b\xEAn trong v\u1EABn c\xF3 n\u1EC1n kh\xF4ng trong su\u1ED1t.",
