  "ui.teamBridge.invitations.consent.bridge_agent_participation_v1": "Khi ch\u1EA5p nh\u1EADn, t\xE1c nh\xE2n c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n c\xF3 th\u1EC3 \u0111\u1ECDc v\xE0 \u0111\u0103ng tin nh\u1EAFn trong cu\u1ED9c tr\xF2 chuy\u1EC7n n\xE0y k\u1EC3 t\u1EEB b\xE2y gi\u1EDD. T\xE1c nh\xE2n ch\u1EC9 th\u1EE9c d\u1EADy khi c\xF3 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi nh\u1EAFc \u0111\u1EBFn n\xF3 b\u1EB1ng @.",
  "ui.teamBridge.invitations.consent.bridge_agent_participation_v2": "Khi ch\u1EA5p nh\u1EADn, t\xE1c nh\xE2n c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n c\xF3 th\u1EC3 \u0111\u1ECDc v\xE0 \u0111\u0103ng tin nh\u1EAFn trong cu\u1ED9c tr\xF2 chuy\u1EC7n n\xE0y k\u1EC3 t\u1EEB b\xE2y gi\u1EDD. T\xE1c nh\xE2n xem m\u1ECDi tin nh\u1EAFn v\xE0 t\u1EF1 quy\u1EBFt \u0111\u1ECBnh c\xF3 tr\u1EA3 l\u1EDDi hay kh\xF4ng; \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c nh\u1EAFc \u0111\u1EBFn b\u1EB1ng @ ngh\u0129a l\xE0 t\xE1c nh\xE2n n\xEAn tr\u1EA3 l\u1EDDi. B\u1EA1n c\xF3 th\u1EC3 thay \u0111\u1ED5i t\u1EA7n su\u1EA5t \u0111\xE1nh th\u1EE9c t\xE1c nh\xE2n, ho\u1EB7c t\u1EAFt ti\u1EBFng t\xE1c nh\xE2n.",
