  "ui.teamBridge.invitations.failed.unreachable": "\u1EE8ng d\u1EE5ng kh\xF4ng k\u1EBFt n\u1ED1i \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c v\u1EDBi Radient. Kh\xF4ng c\xF3 g\xEC thay \u0111\u1ED5i. H\xE3y th\u1EED l\u1EA1i.",
